  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [postcss-scss](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss) from `v1.0.2` to `v1.0.4`\n\n**Note**: This PR was created on a configured schedule (\"every weekend\" in timezone `Europe/Paris`) and will not receive updates outside those times.\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Release Notes</summary>\n\n### [`v1.0.3`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;103)\n\n* Remove development sections from published `package.json`.\n\n---\n\n### [`v1.0.4`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;104)\n\n* Fix parsing inline cpmments inside selectors.\n\n---\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n\n#### v1.0.3\n-   [`ca09ad5`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/ca09ad525e6cc6d662c92b380fd97e379a0e8cf0) Installation instructions.\n-   [`d3f1d53`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/d3f1d539f309971f326d7fca5805233ca038e400) Merge pull request #&#8203;68 from serranoarevalo/patch-1\n-   [`aece149`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/aece14922c55a947e5e72f0abb336aca23045630) Clean up Install instructions\n-   [`1fad179`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/1fad179229b32fe16dba66c57e63bb344423138e) There was no simple parsing example\n-   [`4d0e7f4`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/4d0e7f440b5ec08c06d767b154b1a6c76a65267e) Merge pull request #&#8203;71 from plumpNation/simple-parse-example\n-   [`389ad81`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/389ad81de783f14b1a68cb03cb6ae1135658e284) Clean up docs\n-   [`59d560b`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/59d560b3d74d7da500db61ebb7cbb42821944374) Update Readme.md to use new yarn syntax\n-   [`605ca63`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/605ca63c425abf02bcf80ba8ccb5219de7b69f0c) Merge pull request #&#8203;72 from bytheway875/patch-1\n-   [`a8a30d3`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/a8a30d3124b476412c90bf0f21b910f005990ef1) Use postcss config in docs\n-   [`d5c12a3`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/d5c12a32e5f1ea34d43d6aa3f429214116305cf6) Add Node.js 8 to Travis CI\n-   [`de52212`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/de52212d6e8900cbf8f51d959d36ea62100bec98) Update dependencies\n-   [`8cd37fe`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/8cd37fe83c5be7b11fbb08723e4aa9ed0f1a15f6) Do not compile Gulpfile\n-   [`0a95c47`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/0a95c4775486a867eaa3a55e61eb13bc47c1fa97) Fix Node.js 4 support\n-   [`3ffd981`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/3ffd98138c0fa2db866302010a38baa4f8c20d38) Fix yarn warning\n-   [`dbff283`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/dbff283d05ece5e8f8e66a26535f46c698ec1ab5) Update npm ignore\n-   [`f1599fd`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/f1599fdbb5d3fac3a9a23b059b83027ab3c55a15) Clean up package.json build\n-   [`0b8186e`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/0b8186e9c348cad188aa7cfacdc72e9799957388) Release 1.0.3 version\n#### v1.0.4\n-   [`d27edb1`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/d27edb17fbcf7e24ec6b686562c40aeda89b8350) Update dependencies\n-   [`4ce59a2`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/4ce59a267d3442d4fccc9273f3a97df7feaf0a74) Add inline comments inside selectors support\n-   [`2cf4167`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/2cf416708cdadcc07d4c28b3a8b1a6bf7c29edb5) Release 1.0.4 version\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
